OL,3,GNEWSAGiant cardboard replica of
OL,4,Ahistoric pier created
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant cardboard replica of a historic
OL,7,Fpier has been created by 400 people
OL,8,Fusing 2,000 boxes and 23.6 miles of
OL,9,Fsticky tape.
OL,11,FThe six-storey-high structure, based on
OL,12,FWeston-super-Mare's Birnbeck Pier, was
OL,13,Fdue to be hauled into place alongside
OL,14,Fthe real thing on Saturday.
OL,16,FDesigned by visual artist Oliver
OL,17,FGrossetete, who is known for creating
OL,18,Flarge cardboard sculptures of
OL,19,Farchitectural sites, has attracted
OL,20,Fvolunteer helpers from all over the
OL,21,Fworld.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
