OL,3,GNEWSAGiant cardboard replica of
OL,4,Ahistoric pier created
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The spirit of the project is to make
OL,7,Fsomething together," said Grossetete.
OL,8,F"I like cardboard because it is open to
OL,9,Fall people. For me, it's between
OL,10,Farchitecture and a social project."
